A '''Tuber''' (Japanese: '''うきわボーイ''' ''Inner Tube Boy'' and '''うきわガール''' ''Inner Tube Girl'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] that debuted in the [[Generation III]] games. They are young children in inner tubes that are learning to swim. They come in male and female versions. They appear to be younger versions of {{tc|Swimmer}}s. The [[prize money]] for defeating them is generally low.

When male Tubers are paired with female Swimmers in [[Double Battle]]s, they are called {{tc|Sis & Bro}}s.

They generally use a combination of {{type|Water}} and {{type|Normal}} {{OBP|Pokémon|species}}—particularly {{p|Marill}}, {{p|Zigzagoon}}, and their related forms.

