==Trivia==
*In {{2v2|FireRed|LeafGreen}}, there are no male Tubers, and the male version of the Trainer class is not even programmed into the games, despite there being a {{tc|Sis & Bro|Sis and Bro}} Trainer class (which is a female {{tc|Swimmer}} paired with a male Tuber).
*In the [[Generation IV]] [[Battle Frontier (Generation IV)|Battle Frontier]], male Tubers use the [[Ninja Boy]] overworld sprite, while female Tubers use the [[Twins]] overworld sprite.

